Template: stem/automatic-updates
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Install new Stem releases automatically?
 Once a day, around 03:00, Stem checks for a newer release, verifies its
 signature and provenance, and installs it. It never updates while a test
 is running, and a failed update rolls back.
 .
 Leave this off on a network without internet access. You can change it
 later in Settings or with "stem update --automatic on|off".
